Cell["\<\
Dropping the far vertex breaks inextensibility, so the truncation is no \
longer a ray.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8477f4b9-100f-40a9-b51a-d44671c4d7eb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

